sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as UI (Activity)
    participant VM as RoomTaskViewModel
    participant Repo as RoomTaskRepository
    participant DAO as TaskDao (Room DB)
    participant WM as WorkManager
    participant Worker as TaskSyncWorker
    participant Server as Server (LocalMockTaskServer / API)

    Note over UI,WM: Offline Task Creation & Scheduling
    UI->>VM: createTask(title, description, priority)
    VM->>Repo: createTask(...)
    Repo->>DAO: insertTask(entity: syncState = 0 [PENDING], clientId: UUID)
    DAO-->>Repo: Insert Success & observeTasks() Flow update
    Repo-->>VM: Flow emits mapped List<Task>
    VM-->>UI: RoomTaskUiState.Success(tasks) StateFlow emits to Activity
    Repo->>WM: enqueueUniqueWork("TaskSyncWork", REPLACE, CONNECTED constraint)

    Note over WM,Server: Background Synchronization Execution
    WM-->>Worker: Executes doWork() when NetworkType.CONNECTED
    Worker->>DAO: resetSyncingTasksToPending() (recovers stuck syncState: 1 -> 0)
    Worker->>DAO: getPendingTasks() (syncState = 0)
    DAO-->>Worker: List<TaskEntity>
    Worker->>DAO: updateSyncState(id, syncState = 1 [SYNCING])
    Worker->>Server: POST /tasks (TaskUploadRequest with stable clientId)
    Note over Server: LocalMockTaskServer stores payload by clientId via putIfAbsent()

    alt Success (HTTP 2xx Response)
        Server-->>Worker: 200 OK (TaskUploadResponse)
        Worker->>DAO: updateSyncState(id, syncState = 2 [SYNCED])
        Worker-->>WM: Returns Result.success()
        DAO-->>Repo: observeTasks() Flow emits updated List<TaskEntity>
        Repo-->>VM: Flow emits mapped List<Task>
        VM-->>UI: RoomTaskUiState.Success(tasks) StateFlow emits to Activity
    else Temporary Failure (HTTP 5xx / Network Disconnect / Timeout)
        Server-->>Worker: 5xx Server Error / IOException
        Worker->>DAO: updateSyncState(id, syncState = 0 [PENDING])
        Worker-->>WM: Returns Result.retry()
        Note over Worker,WM: WorkManager reschedules execution with exponential backoff
    else Permanent Failure (HTTP 4xx Response)
        Server-->>Worker: 4xx Client Error (e.g. 400 Bad Request)
        Worker->>DAO: updateSyncState(id, syncState = 3 [FAILED / PERMANENT_ERROR])
        Worker-->>WM: Returns Result.failure()
    end